      "text": [
        "911 - وَقَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «اَلْمَوْلُودُ إِذَا وُلِدَ يُؤَذَّنُ فِي أُذُنِهِ اَلْيُمْنَى وَ يُقَامُ فِي اَلْيُسْرَى."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.911 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"When a child is born, the adhan (call to prayer) should be recited in their right ear, and the iqamah (call to commence prayer) in their left ear.\""
        ]
      }
